# Normalize line endings to LF for text files, regardless of platform or
# a checkout runner's core.autocrlf setting (GitHub's windows-latest
# runners default to true, which silently converts files like
# CHANGELOG.md to CRLF on checkout — this bit the in-app changelog viewer,
# since it gets bundled as a Tauri resource and read back verbatim).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch binary files.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
